    "title": "Two bids for Charlottesville's Barracks / Rugby project appear to be under budget - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sean Tubbs ,\n1 days ago Charlottesville is finally moving ahead with several projects funded in the late 2010’s under the Virginia Department of Transportation’s Smart Scale process. One of them is a scaled-back version of a project to modify the intersection of Emmet Street and Barracks Road, a project that also includes a wider sidewalk halfway up the hill to the east toward downtown Charlottesville. Read full article",
